    "description": "Read what typed text means as a measured value in this document: Revit parses it for the given spec with the document's own units and answers with the value converted into the given display unit plus Revit's own rendering of it in that unit (no symbol). Read-only, no transaction. A surface stages { text, unit }; a refusal carries Revit's reason and stages nothing.",
