    "visibility": "EscalationVisible",
    "needs": "project-document",
    "description": "Write reviewed schedule cells by their exact reviewed bindings (target element id, parameter id, storage, read-only, hasValue, raw value) in one transaction. Stale, missing, blocked, or conflicting evidence refuses per cell; results keep the request cell index and each cell's own target index.",
